From: ReadyNAS NG <readynasng@build>
Subject: [PATCH 18/23] platform: padre: add the SATA driver

libata SFF driver for the two SATA ports of the IT3107, written from
the GPL 2.6.17 IDE driver (PIO) and its IO description: 32-bit shadow
register accesses, the driver's own SFF operations; DMA through the
List Processor (padre_sata.dma=1, checked against PIO at boot);
padre_sata.read_only=1 refuses writes.
